            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new run of words: what did the last two words of the chapter before mean?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: सूरज",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सूरज (sūraj) — \"the sun\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "From Sanskrit सूर्य (sūrya), and behind that the Proto-Indo-European word for the sun, which also gives Latin sōl, Greek hḗlios, and English sun."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "That makes सूरज (sūraj) a cousin of solar and of sun at once — the Latin word arriving in English through scholarship, the inherited one having been there all along. Same root, two doors."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The first of five things overhead."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "sūraj",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *sūraj*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "it once more, slowly",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: it once more, slowly]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "sūraj, and hear sol inside it",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *sūraj*, and hear *sol* inside it]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
